  },
  "events": [
    {
      "at": "2026-09-09T08:45:24Z",
      "type": "artifacts-created",
      "by": "leader",
      "detail": "Tier 4 artifacts created and validated with openspec validate --strict. Worker confirmed it reuses tier 2's real ui.StatTileProps.Trend and the trending_up/trending_down Icon glyphs, not a second trend mechanism. No database change, so no design gate. One decision the roadmap did not cover went to the user: the 0.0-delta rendering (D-zero-delta)."
    }
  ]
